---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="WRAP Certification Audit Services in India | Eurocert"
  description="Explore WRAP certification audits in India with Eurocert, a WRAP-accredited monitoring firm. Review requirements, cost factors and request an audit quote."
  canonicalUrl="https://www.eurocert.asia/social-audits/wrap/"
  ogImage="https://res.cloudinary.com/dwnnakrrh/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto:good,w_1600/v1782367859/eurocert/Untitled_design_19_.png.png"
  keywords="WRAP certification India,WRAP audit,WRAP accredited monitoring firm,WRAP certification cost,WRAP 12 Principles,WRAP facility audit,Eurocert,WRAP,SA8000,social audits,certification body,India"
>
<style is:global>@font-face{font-family:"Font Awesome 6 Free";font-style:normal;font-weight:900;font-display:swap;src:url(https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.5.1/webfonts/fa-solid-900.woff2) format('woff2')}@font-face{font-family:"Font Awesome 6 Brands";font-style:normal;font-weight:400;font-display:swap;src:url(https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.5.1/webfonts/fa-brands-400.woff2) format('woff2')}@font-face{font-family:"Font Awesome 6 Free";font-style:normal;font-weight:400;font-display:swap;src:url(https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.5.1/webfonts/fa-regular-400.woff2) format('woff2')}</style>

<!-- SECTION 1 — HERO -->
<section class="relative min-h-[55vh] flex items-center justify-center overflow-hidden bg-[#030a16]">
  <div class="absolute inset-0 z-0">
    <img src="https://res.cloudinary.com/didtfhfme/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto:good,w_1600/v1783917699/wrap_gwgomv.png" class="w-full h-full object-cover opacity-30" alt="WRAP Certification"/>
    <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-b from-[#030a16]/70 via-[#030a16]/40 to-[#030a16]"></div>
  </div>
  <div class="container mx-auto px-6 relative z-10 text-center py-20">
    <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-4 py-1.5 rounded-full border border-eurogold-400/30 bg-eurogold-400/5 mb-6">
      <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-eurogold-400 animate-pulse"></span>
      <span class="heading-font text-[10px] text-eurogold-400 tracking-[0.3em] uppercase font-bold">Independent Facility Audits</span>
    </div>
    <h1 class="heading-font text-4xl sm:text-6xl md:text-7xl font-bold text-white mb-5 tracking-tight" style="text-shadow:0 0 30px rgba(212,168,67,0.3)">WRAP Certification Audit <span class="text-eurogold-400">Services in India</span></h1>
    <p class="text-white/90 text-sm md:text-base max-w-2xl mx-auto leading-relaxed mb-3">Planning WRAP certification for your manufacturing facility? EUROCERT is listed as a WRAP-accredited monitoring firm for India.</p>
    <p class="text-white/70 text-sm max-w-2xl mx-auto leading-relaxed mb-8">Contact our team to discuss your facility, application status and audit requirements. Eurocert conducts the monitoring audit; WRAP makes the certification decision.</p>
    <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-3 justify-center">
      <a class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 heading-font text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-[#030a16] bg-eurogold-400 rounded-full px-8 py-3.5 hover:bg-eurogold-300 transition-all shadow-lg shadow-eurogold-400/20" href="/contact/">Request a WRAP Audit Quote <i class="fas fa-arrow-right text-[9px]"></i></a>
      <a class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 heading-font text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-white border border-white/15 rounded-full px-8 py-3.5 hover:bg-white/5 transition-all" href="/contact/">Discuss Your Facility</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- SECTION 2 — OFFICIAL VERIFICATION PANEL -->
<section class="py-14 lg:py-18 bg-white border-t border-slate-100">
  <div class="container mx-auto px-6">
    <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto grid lg:grid-cols-[1.1fr_0.9fr] gap-6 items-stretch">
      <div class="flex flex-col justify-center p-6 sm:p-8 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-[#f8fafc]">
        <div class="text-left">
          <h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] text-euro-600 tracking-[0.5em] uppercase mb-2 font-bold">Official Verification</h4>
          <h2 class="heading-font text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold text-slate-900 tracking-tight leading-tight mb-5">Verify Eurocert&#8217;s <span class="text-euro-600">WRAP Monitoring-Firm Status</span></h2>
        </div>
        <div class="space-y-4">
          <p class="text-slate-500 text-[15px] leading-relaxed">EUROCERT appears in WRAP&#8217;s official accredited monitoring-firm directory with India listed as an accredited country.</p>
          <p class="text-slate-500 text-[15px] leading-relaxed">You can check the listing directly in WRAP&#8217;s directory.</p>
          <p class="text-slate-500 text-[15px] leading-relaxed">Select <strong class="font-semibold text-slate-700">EUROCERT</strong> under Firm Group and <strong class="font-semibold text-slate-700">India</strong> under Country / Region.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="mt-6">
          <a class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 heading-font text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-[#030a16] bg-eurogold-400 rounded-full px-7 py-3.5 hover:bg-eurogold-300 transition-all shadow-lg shadow-eurogold-400/20 text-center" href="https://wrap-maps.azurewebsites.net/monitoring-map" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Verify EUROCERT in WRAP&#8217;s Monitoring-Firm Directory <i class="fas fa-external-link-alt text-[9px]"></i></a>
        </div>
        <p class="mt-auto pt-6 text-slate-400 text-[12px] leading-relaxed">Monitoring-firm accreditation authorizes the auditing role. It does not mean that Eurocert issues WRAP certificates or guarantees certification.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="flex items-center justify-center p-8 rounded-2xl border border-euro-100 bg-euro-50/40 min-h-[200px]">
        <img src="/wrap%20logo.svg" alt="WRAP logo" class="w-full max-w-[260px] object-contain" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- SECTION 3 — OVERVIEW -->
<section class="py-14 lg:py-18 bg-[#f8fafc] border-t border-slate-100">
  <div class="container mx-auto px-6">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto space-y-6">
      <div>
        <h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] text-euro-600 tracking-[0.5em] uppercase mb-2 font-bold">Overview</h4>
        <h2 class="heading-font text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-slate-900 tracking-tight leading-tight">What Is <span class="text-euro-600">WRAP Certification?</span></h2>
      </div>
      <p class="text-slate-500 text-[15px] leading-relaxed">Worldwide Responsible Accredited Production (WRAP) operates a social compliance certification programme for individual production facilities. It focuses mainly on apparel, footwear, sewn products and related manufacturing.</p>
      <p class="text-slate-500 text-[15px] leading-relaxed">The programme assesses workplace practices against WRAP&#8217;s 12 Principles.</p>
      <p class="text-slate-500 text-[15px] leading-relaxed">WRAP certification is facility-specific. It does not automatically certify a parent company, a brand or every factory in a group, and it is not a product-quality certification.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- SECTION 4 — EUROCERT'S ROLE -->
<section class="py-14 lg:py-18 bg-white border-t border-slate-100">
  <div class="container mx-auto px-6">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto space-y-6">
      <div>
        <h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] text-euro-600 tracking-[0.5em] uppercase mb-2 font-bold">Our Role</h4>
        <h2 class="heading-font text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-slate-900 tracking-tight leading-tight">Eurocert Audits the Facility. <span class="text-euro-600">WRAP Decides on Certification.</span></h2>
      </div>
      <p class="text-slate-500 text-[15px] leading-relaxed">As the monitoring firm, Eurocert conducts the facility audit and submits its findings to WRAP.</p>
      <p class="text-slate-500 text-[15px] leading-relaxed">The facility is responsible for implementing any required corrective actions. WRAP reviews the audit information and determines whether its certification requirements have been met.</p>
      <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl border border-euro-100 bg-euro-50/40">
        <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm leading-relaxed">Neither booking an audit nor paying the applicable fees guarantees certification.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- SECTION 5 — ELIGIBILITY -->
<section class="py-14 lg:py-18 bg-[#f8fafc] border-t border-slate-100">
  <div class="container mx-auto px-6">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto">
      <div class="mb-6">
        <h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] text-euro-600 tracking-[0.5em] uppercase mb-2 font-bold">Eligibility</h4>
        <h2 class="heading-font text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-slate-900 tracking-tight leading-tight">Which Facilities Can Apply for <span class="text-euro-600">WRAP Certification?</span></h2>
      </div>
      <p class="text-slate-500 text-[15px] leading-relaxed mb-5">WRAP is relevant to individual production facilities in apparel, footwear, textiles, sewn products and related industries.</p>
      <p class="text-slate-500 text-[15px] leading-relaxed mb-4">Before applying, confirm:</p>
      <ul class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 gap-3 mb-6">
        <li class="flex items-start gap-3 p-4 rounded-xl bg-white border border-slate-100 text-slate-600 text-sm leading-relaxed"><i class="fas fa-check text-euro-600 mt-1 text-[10px]"></i><span>Your facility&#8217;s eligibility</span></li>
        <li class="flex items-start gap-3 p-4 rounded-xl bg-white border border-slate-100 text-slate-600 text-sm leading-relaxed"><i class="fas fa-check text-euro-600 mt-1 text-[10px]"></i><span>Your buyer&#8217;s acceptance requirements</span></li>
        <li class="flex items-start gap-3 p-4 rounded-xl bg-white border border-slate-100 text-slate-600 text-sm leading-relaxed"><i class="fas fa-check text-euro-600 mt-1 text-[10px]"></i><span>The production unit covered by the application</span></li>
        <li class="flex items-start gap-3 p-4 rounded-xl bg-white border border-slate-100 text-slate-600 text-sm leading-relaxed"><i class="fas fa-check text-euro-600 mt-1 text-[10px]"></i><span>The monitoring firm&#8217;s coverage for the facility location</span></li>
      </ul>
      <p class="text-slate-500 text-[15px] leading-relaxed">Contact our team with your manufacturing activity and site details to discuss the audit arrangements.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- SECTION 6 — PRINCIPLES -->
<section class="py-14 lg:py-18 bg-white border-t border-slate-100">
  <div class="container mx-auto px-6">
    <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto">
      <div class="text-center mb-10">
        <h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] text-euro-600 tracking-[0.5em] uppercase mb-2 font-bold">Standards</h4>
        <h2 class="heading-font text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-slate-900 tracking-tight">WRAP&#8217;s <span class="text-euro-600">12 Principles</span></h2>
      </div>
      <div class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-4 mb-6">
        <div class="p-5 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-[#f8fafc] flex items-start gap-3"><span class="heading-font text-eurogold-400 font-bold text-lg leading-none mt-0.5">01</span><span class="text-slate-700 text-sm font-medium leading-snug">Compliance with Laws and Workplace Regulations</span></div>
        <div class="p-5 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-[#f8fafc] flex items-start gap-3"><span class="heading-font text-eurogold-400 font-bold text-lg leading-none mt-0.5">02</span><span class="text-slate-700 text-sm font-medium leading-snug">Prohibition of Forced Labor</span></div>
        <div class="p-5 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-[#f8fafc] flex items-start gap-3"><span class="heading-font text-eurogold-400 font-bold text-lg leading-none mt-0.5">03</span><span class="text-slate-700 text-sm font-medium leading-snug">Prohibition of Child Labor</span></div>
        <div class="p-5 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-[#f8fafc] flex items-start gap-3"><span class="heading-font text-eurogold-400 font-bold text-lg leading-none mt-0.5">04</span><span class="text-slate-700 text-sm font-medium leading-snug">Prohibition of Harassment and Abuse</span></div>
        <div class="p-5 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-[#f8fafc] flex items-start gap-3"><span class="heading-font text-eurogold-400 font-bold text-lg leading-none mt-0.5">05</span><span class="text-slate-700 text-sm font-medium leading-snug">Compensation and Benefits</span></div>
        <div class="p-5 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-[#f8fafc] flex items-start gap-3"><span class="heading-font text-eurogold-400 font-bold text-lg leading-none mt-0.5">06</span><span class="text-slate-700 text-sm font-medium leading-snug">Hours of Work</span></div>
        <div class="p-5 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-[#f8fafc] flex items-start gap-3"><span class="heading-font text-eurogold-400 font-bold text-lg leading-none mt-0.5">07</span><span class="text-slate-700 text-sm font-medium leading-snug">Prohibition of Discrimination</span></div>
        <div class="p-5 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-[#f8fafc] flex items-start gap-3"><span class="heading-font text-eurogold-400 font-bold text-lg leading-none mt-0.5">08</span><span class="text-slate-700 text-sm font-medium leading-snug">Health and Safety</span></div>
        <div class="p-5 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-[#f8fafc] flex items-start gap-3"><span class="heading-font text-eurogold-400 font-bold text-lg leading-none mt-0.5">09</span><span class="text-slate-700 text-sm font-medium leading-snug">Freedom of Association and Collective Bargaining</span></div>
        <div class="p-5 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-[#f8fafc] flex items-start gap-3"><span class="heading-font text-eurogold-400 font-bold text-lg leading-none mt-0.5">10</span><span class="text-slate-700 text-sm font-medium leading-snug">Environment</span></div>
        <div class="p-5 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-[#f8fafc] flex items-start gap-3"><span class="heading-font text-eurogold-400 font-bold text-lg leading-none mt-0.5">11</span><span class="text-slate-700 text-sm font-medium leading-snug">Customs Compliance</span></div>
        <div class="p-5 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-[#f8fafc] flex items-start gap-3"><span class="heading-font text-eurogold-400 font-bold text-lg leading-none mt-0.5">12</span><span class="text-slate-700 text-sm font-medium leading-snug">Security</span></div>
      </div>
      <p class="text-slate-500 text-[15px] leading-relaxed">The audit considers management systems, records and actual workplace practices. Written policies must be supported by implementation.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- SECTION 7 — PROCESS -->
<section class="py-14 lg:py-18 bg-[#f8fafc] border-t border-slate-100">
  <div class="container mx-auto px-6">
    <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto">
      <div class="text-center mb-10">
        <h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] text-euro-600 tracking-[0.5em] uppercase mb-2 font-bold">Process</h4>
        <h2 class="heading-font text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-slate-900 tracking-tight">The WRAP <span class="text-euro-600">Certification Process</span></h2>
      </div>
      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-5">
        <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white">
          <span class="heading-font text-eurogold-400 font-bold text-2xl block mb-2 leading-none">01</span>
          <h3 class="heading-font text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-900 mb-2">Apply to WRAP</h3>
          <p class="text-slate-500 text-sm leading-relaxed">The facility submits its application, selects an accredited monitoring firm and pays the applicable registration fee.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white">
          <span class="heading-font text-eurogold-400 font-bold text-2xl block mb-2 leading-none">02</span>
          <h3 class="heading-font text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-900 mb-2">Review readiness</h3>
          <p class="text-slate-500 text-sm leading-relaxed">The facility can use WRAP&#8217;s optional pre-audit self-assessment resources to understand the requirements and organize information.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white">
          <span class="heading-font text-eurogold-400 font-bold text-2xl block mb-2 leading-none">03</span>
          <h3 class="heading-font text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-900 mb-2">Complete the facility audit</h3>
          <p class="text-slate-500 text-sm leading-relaxed">The monitoring firm examines relevant records, workplace conditions and management practices.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white">
          <span class="heading-font text-eurogold-400 font-bold text-2xl block mb-2 leading-none">04</span>
          <h3 class="heading-font text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-900 mb-2">Address findings</h3>
          <p class="text-slate-500 text-sm leading-relaxed">The facility implements required corrective actions and provides evidence for verification.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white">
          <span class="heading-font text-eurogold-400 font-bold text-2xl block mb-2 leading-none">05</span>
          <h3 class="heading-font text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-900 mb-2">WRAP reviews the outcome</h3>
          <p class="text-slate-500 text-sm leading-relaxed">The audit report is submitted to WRAP. WRAP reviews the information and makes the certification decision.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- SECTION 8 — COST -->
<section class="py-14 lg:py-18 bg-white border-t border-slate-100">
  <div class="container mx-auto px-6">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto">
      <div class="mb-6">
        <h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] text-euro-600 tracking-[0.5em] uppercase mb-2 font-bold">Cost</h4>
        <h2 class="heading-font text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-slate-900 tracking-tight leading-tight">WRAP Certification <span class="text-euro-600">Cost in India</span></h2>
      </div>
      <p class="text-slate-500 text-[15px] leading-relaxed mb-5">The overall cost includes the applicable WRAP registration fee and the monitoring firm&#8217;s audit charges.</p>
      <p class="text-slate-500 text-[15px] leading-relaxed mb-5">Audit charges depend on factors such as facility location, workforce, required audit time, travel and follow-up work.</p>
      <div class="p-7 rounded-2xl border border-euro-100 bg-euro-50/40 mb-5">
        <h3 class="heading-font text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-900 mb-4">For a quotation, share:</h3>
        <ul class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 gap-2 text-slate-600 text-sm leading-relaxed">
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><i class="fas fa-check text-euro-600 mt-1 text-[10px]"></i><span>Facility name and location</span></li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><i class="fas fa-check text-euro-600 mt-1 text-[10px]"></i><span>Products manufactured</span></li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><i class="fas fa-check text-euro-600 mt-1 text-[10px]"></i><span>Approximate workforce and shifts</span></li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><i class="fas fa-check text-euro-600 mt-1 text-[10px]"></i><span>New application or renewal</span></li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><i class="fas fa-check text-euro-600 mt-1 text-[10px]"></i><span>Buyer requirements</span></li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><i class="fas fa-check text-euro-600 mt-1 text-[10px]"></i><span>Current WRAP application status</span></li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <a class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 heading-font text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-[#030a16] bg-eurogold-400 rounded-full px-8 py-3.5 hover:bg-eurogold-300 transition-all shadow-lg shadow-eurogold-400/20" href="/contact/">Request a WRAP Audit Quote <i class="fas fa-arrow-right text-[9px]"></i></a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- SECTION 9 — PREPARATION -->
<section class="py-14 lg:py-18 bg-[#f8fafc] border-t border-slate-100">
  <div class="container mx-auto px-6">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto space-y-5">
      <div>
        <h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] text-euro-600 tracking-[0.5em] uppercase mb-2 font-bold">Preparation</h4>
        <h2 class="heading-font text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-slate-900 tracking-tight leading-tight">Preparing for Your <span class="text-euro-600">WRAP Facility Audit</span></h2>
      </div>
      <p class="text-slate-500 text-[15px] leading-relaxed">Organize accurate employment, wage, working-hour, safety and operational records. Review the requirements relevant to your facility and ensure workers and management can participate in the assessment.</p>
      <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl border border-euro-100 bg-white">
        <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm leading-relaxed"><strong class="text-slate-700">The audit examines how requirements are implemented in practice.</strong> Documents must accurately reflect facility operations.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- SECTION 10 — FAQ -->
<section class="py-14 lg:py-18 bg-white border-t border-slate-100">
  <div class="container mx-auto px-6">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto space-y-8">
      <div>
        <h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] text-euro-600 tracking-[0.5em] uppercase mb-2 font-bold">FAQ</h4>
        <h2 class="heading-font text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-slate-900 tracking-tight leading-tight">WRAP Certification <span class="text-euro-600">FAQs</span></h2>
      </div>
      <div>
        <details class="seo-faq">
          <summary>Is Eurocert a WRAP-accredited monitoring firm for India?</summary>
          <div class="ans">EUROCERT is listed in WRAP&#8217;s official monitoring-firm directory for India. Use the verification link above to check the listing directly.</div>
        </details>
        <details class="seo-faq">
          <summary>Does Eurocert issue WRAP certification?</summary>
          <div class="ans">No. Eurocert conducts the monitoring audit and submits its findings. WRAP makes the certification decision.</div>
        </details>
        <details class="seo-faq">
          <summary>Can one WRAP certificate cover multiple factories?</summary>
          <div class="ans">Each individual production unit must undergo the applicable certification process. One facility&#8217;s certificate does not automatically cover other factories.</div>
        </details>
        <details class="seo-faq">
          <summary>Is WRAP certification a product-quality guarantee?</summary>
          <div class="ans">No. WRAP assesses facility-level social compliance, not the quality or performance of individual products.</div>
        </details>
        <details class="seo-faq">
          <summary>Will every buyer accept WRAP certification?</summary>
          <div class="ans">Acceptance requirements differ. Confirm your buyer&#8217;s requirements before applying.</div>
        </details>
        <details class="seo-faq">
          <summary>How long does the process take?</summary>
          <div class="ans">Timing depends on audit availability, facility readiness, findings, corrective actions and WRAP&#8217;s review. Request a facility-specific schedule.</div>
        </details>
        <details class="seo-faq">
          <summary>What happens if the audit identifies problems?</summary>
          <div class="ans">The facility must address the relevant findings. Verification or further assessment may be needed before WRAP makes its certification decision.</div>
        </details>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- SECTION 11 — FINAL CTA -->
<section class="py-16 lg:py-20 bg-[#030a16]">
  <div class="container mx-auto px-6">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto text-center">
